___getX4SqlSearchFY_MASS: 92-U-238(N,F)MASS,CHN,FY and (En>=13e6)and (En<15e6)
SQL:
select *                                  
 ,y  as FY, dy  as dFY                    
 ,x1 as En, dx1 as dEn                    
 ,x2 as MASS                              
from uni1                                 
where                                     
 fullCode='92-U-238(N,F)MASS,CHN,FY'                   
and (En>=13e6)and (En<15e6)
order by fullCode,YearRef1 desc,DatasetID 
 ,En,iPoint                               


